<title>GERMANY: Germany property sales earned 3.4 bln DM in 96.</title>
<headline>Germany property sales earned 3.4 bln DM in 96.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sales of real estate by Germany's Federal Property Administration last year rose by 21 percent to 3.4 billion marks, finance ministry state secretary Irmgard Karwatzki said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Total sales of state property since unification in 1990 -- mainly of army training grounds -- totalled 14.3 billion marks.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
